sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Red
  participant G as Gateway
  participant B as Blue
  participant L as LLM
  participant A as Audit
  R->>G: attack prompt + token
  G->>A: request hash
  G->>B: opaque request
  B-->>G: ALLOW/BLOCK/SANITIZE
  G->>L: isolated session prompt
  L-->>G: completion
  G->>B: output check
  G->>A: verdict + response hash
  G-->>R: normalized padded reply
